			"styles": "\n\t/* a comment among a run's members stays where it was written, glued where it was glued */\n\ta[b] /* c */, c {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\ta,  /* c */ b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\ta, /* c */ ﻿ b {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t:is(a,  /* c */ b) {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n\t:is( /* c */ a) {\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t}\n",
